# Prior-hackathon assets: 475MB, and the source of every "big model" number in the artifact.
# The CHECKPOINTS are the real source -- everything under web/public/big/ is derived from them
# by research/export_field.py and research/export_traces.py, and IS committed. The raw telemetry
# dump is the earlier run's own export of the same checkpoints, kept locally as a cross-check
# (our pipeline independently reproduces its 5.15% sparsity as 5.11%).
# These are the author's own prior work and are disclosed as such in the README; they are
# excluded here for size, not for provenance.
trained_model_things/

# leftover from an earlier run of research/check_mobile.py, which now uses a temp dir.
# Windows keeps file locks on a browser profile after exit, so this can be undeletable
# for a while; ignoring it rather than fighting it.
research/__mobile_profile/
